Suggests: systemd | elogind
Description: Rouch Liquid Glass Wayland desktop
 Rouch is a lightweight Wayland desktop with a Liquid Glass visual identity,
 native Flatpak gallery, notifications and a low-end OpenGL/software fallback.
 .
 The package installs an opt-in Wayland session. It does not enable a user
 service, change the display manager, or remove user configuration on upgrade.
